sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App1 as App on Node 1
  participant Besu1 as Besu / Node 1
  participant Tessera1 as Tessera 1
  participant Chain as Public marker transaction
  participant Tessera2 as Tessera 2
  participant Besu2 as Besu / Node 2
  participant App2 as App on Node 2
  participant Besu3 as Besu / Node 3

  App1->>Besu1: Submit private tx request
  Besu1->>Tessera1: Forward payload + privacy metadata

  Note over Tessera1: Tessera 1 stores the private payload
  Note over Tessera1,Tessera2: Shares encrypted payload only with permitted participants

  Tessera1->>Tessera2: Deliver encrypted private payload
  Tessera1-->>Besu1: Return marker/reference for public chain

  Besu1->>Chain: Sign and broadcast marker tx
  Chain-->>Besu1: Included in block

  Tessera2-->>Besu2: Provide private payload to Node 2
  Besu2->>Besu2: Execute private tx locally
  Besu2-->>App2: Private receipt available

  Note over Besu3: Node 3 is not a participant
  Besu3-->>Besu3: Can only see public marker tx
